From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: avdim <avdimdv@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 01:40:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] chagall-common: audio: Hardware limiter + loudness on the
 speaker (DRC1)

Route AIF1 through the WM5102 DRC1 before SPKOUT. Configure it as a
limiter with +6 dB of make-up below a -15 dB knee and a hard ceiling at
-9 dBFS. The speaker path then gets louder without clipping the +8.5 dB
digital gain that follows.

The lines are set once at audio HAL start, at top level, and no path
touches them, so DAPM powers DRC1 together with the speaker path.

This requires a kernel without the Wolfson Control regmap hook. With the
stock kernel the SPKOUT input write is silently replaced while DAPM
believes it, and playback freezes. Every line is tagged "drc-speaker" so
that it can be stripped on such kernels.

Verified on SM-T800 with the patched kernel: stable over stream
start/stop and reboot, volume steps work, no distortion at full volume.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I46c1005fe1869ceb11e0a2c321ac2c890309fd1c
---
 configs/audio/mixer_paths_0.xml | 23 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 23 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/audio/mixer_paths_0.xml b/configs/audio/mixer_paths_0.xml
index 96de205..1f99ed5 100644
--- a/configs/audio/mixer_paths_0.xml
+++ b/configs/audio/mixer_paths_0.xml
@@ -108,6 +108,29 @@
     <ctl name="3rd Mic Switch" value="0" />
     <ctl name="Headset Mic Switch" value="0" />
 
+    <!-- MOD: hardware limiter + loudness on the speaker (WM5102 DRC1 between AIF1 and SPKOUT).
+         Needs a kernel without the Wolfson Control regmap hook (universal5420-common
+         patches/kernel/samsung/exynos5420/0001): on the stock kernel the SPKOUT input write is
+         silently replaced while DAPM believes it (playback freeze). Lines tagged drc-speaker are
+         stripped by the chagall_fixes Magisk module on other kernels.
+         T1: DRC1_CTRL1..5 = 0018 0933 0028 028C 0000 (bytes, hex): QR + anticlip, knee
+         -15 dB in -> -9 dB out (+6 dB below the knee), hard limit above it (-9 dBFS before the
+         speaker's +8.5 dB digital gain). Set once at HAL start; no path touches these. -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="0" value="00" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="1" value="18" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="2" value="09" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="3" value="33" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="4" value="00" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="5" value="28" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="6" value="02" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="7" value="8C" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="8" value="00" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1" id="9" value="00" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1L Input 1" value="AIF1RX1" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="DRC1R Input 1" value="AIF1RX2" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="SPKOUTL Input 1" value="DRC1L" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+    <ctl name="SPKOUTR Input 1" value="DRC1R" /> <!-- drc-speaker -->
+
     <!--
     #######################################################
     ### STOCK AUDIO PATHS
-- 
